        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "We took cover in time, thanks for the warning... *cough*, Janie, what about you? You in one piece?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Operator Oliver"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm okay. Outcast covered me proper.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_479_sleach_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But... what happened outside?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hear lots of screaming... and the children...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Janie"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_245_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jane, don't go outside yet! All of you, stay low and stay in cover. Get away from the windows!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "text": "An explosion of this scale always comes in waves\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Outcast"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
