    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Chef! Mr. Chef\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, where to start? We've got wounded everywhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "ystrength": 40,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_explo_n",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_imp_rock_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough*, *cough*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I have to find Chef! He should be around here. I need to get him out of town!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... Ugh, what's got my leg?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_244"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "A... a hostile?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, you're out like a light. No threat to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_244"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kill... me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Later. Let me move this rock that's got your leg pinned first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Huff\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "There we go! Oh, it's all mush... And these black crystals... Looks serious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_244"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kill... me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't...! The Infected... are dirty... I mustn't be sullied like that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, wheesht. Nothin' wrong with hangin' in there to live another day, is there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_244"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... don't get it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a fate... worse than death...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I don't get it, fine then. I'm lookin' for someone. No one's got help for you now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Chef! Mr\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_244"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hngh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you tugging my leg for this time? This... This apron! Mr. Chef\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "(The rock crushed Chef too. No wonder I couldn't find him.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "(The intel's still here.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "(He tried his best to protect it till the very end. I can tell.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. MacMartin. I don't know your real name\u2014but I will remember you for what you've done.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rest in peace, my friend in arms.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your bravery won't go to waste.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you. I need to thank you, nameless hostile.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should give you what you want. But I can tell, you'll be gone soon even if I don't do a thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Any last words?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_244"
    },
    {
        "text": "...The Leader.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're about to peg out, and your leader's what comes to mind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_244"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah... hahahaha!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "We... will give rise... to... a fire of rebirth!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dublinn Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where're you looking a\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "More and more enemies are pouring in through the ruins."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#2",
