        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Reinforcements?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cannons didn't do a thing...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Captain... They're all gonna be in danger!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to regroup with them\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_222_bpipe_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "My mission's a failure. In that case, takin' the communications center's our last chance!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bagpipe"
    },
